{% call ui.paragraph() %}
After clicking "Join the team" above, you'll be taken to {{ site_name | upper }}. On the login page, use the "Reset password" option to set up your credentials if you don't already have a password. If you run into any issues or have questions, feel free to reach out.
{% endcall %}

{% call ui.paragraph() %}
Welcome aboard!
{% endcall %}

{% call ui.footer() %}
This invitation was intended for {{ email }}. If you were not expecting this invitation, you can ignore this email. 
{% endcall %}
